"credits":"Public Information Films","rights":"UK Crown Copyright","language":"english","coverage":"Great Britain","backup_location":"ia903600_10","ia_orig__runtime":"1 Minutes 2 Seconds"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"This is, as can be seen from the thumbnail, a black and white live-action shortlet.\nIt is a sequel to <a href=\"http://www.archive.org/details/coughs_and_sneezes_TNA\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">Coughs and Sneezes</a>, reminding us what to do with the hankie after a hard day's WHOOOFing into it.\n\nGreat stuff, and I just love the dopey character they used in these films.","reviewtitle":"Ignore the description","stars":"5","reviewer":"boffy_b","createdate":"2005-11-05 16:34:14","reviewdate":"2005-11-05 16:34:14"},{"reviewbody":"I now know what to do with my handkerchiefs and the Mrs. won't wash them, prefering to wash my boxers, instead.  Now, to find disinfectant bowls...\n\nThank you, United Kingdom! :D","reviewtitle":"This is for those who STILL carry hankies!","stars":"5","reviewer":"Mewster","createdate":"2006-11-28 22:47:36","reviewdate":"2006-11-28 22:47:36"},{"reviewbody":"but silly. There are some good tips for those of us who live n the 21st century. Check it!","reviewtitle":"very interesting","reviewer":"Robert99","reviewdate":"2007-09-20 05:40:45","createdate":"2007-09-20 05:40:45","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"Professional quality as always.  On a side note, did you see how high his pants went up his chest?  Why did he bother wearing a shirt?","reviewtitle":"Short sharp and to the point","reviewer":"Framan","reviewdate":"2008-03-09 00:02:45","createdate":"2008-03-09 00:02:45","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"Strange little bit here about how not to spread germs. Same funny brit guy again. Likes beer too. \n\nWho on earth had a bowl of disinfectant lying around?? That was mighty strange. Still enjoyable though.","reviewtitle":"DON'T DRINK IT MAN!!","reviewer":"Spuzz","reviewdate":"2008-03-20 23:20:16","createdate":"2008-03-20 23:20:16","stars":"4"}],"server":"dn800302.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn800302":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5420356389"},"sys_last_changed":"2026-06-06 00:54:12.519842"}}},"solo":true,"uniq":246220062,"workable_servers":["dn800302.us.archive.org"]}